# ----------
# Like in PostgreSQL src/test/regress/parallel_schedule, we put no
# more than twenty tests in any one parallel group; this limits the
# number of connections needed to run the tests.
#
# Most tests here were ported to the e2e suite under test/e2e/fast/
# (cid, rel-truncate, spgist, vacuum-full, plus clog/subxacts which are
# checked in disabled — see issue #115). The two below remain here
# because they don't fit the e2e golden runner: event-triggers needs
# extra roles + a second database and has intentional errors, and
# test-utils needs the neon_test_utils extension.
# ----------

test: neon-test-utils
test: neon-event-triggers
